    {
      "id": "CLIN-24-R2",
      "statement": "`schedule` marks every appointment at a double-booked time: `k2 on 2026-03-09: 09:00 a1 p1 (double-booked), 09:00 a2 p2 (double-booked)`. Acceptance criteria: each statement above holds; the standing requirements in `README.md` hold; existing behaviour is unchanged; `dotnet test Clinic.slnx` passes.",
